{
  "declaredLength": 3728,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨,\n이곳에서 만나다니, 기막힌 우연이군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C000AC774ACF3C5D0C11C0020B9CCB098B2E4B2C8002C0020AE30B9C9D78C0020C6B0C5F0C774AD70C694002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금부터 거래처와 미팅이 있습니다만,\n괜찮으시다면 견학해 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE08BD80D1300020AC70B798CC98C6400020BBF8D305C7740020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4B9CC002C000AAD1CCC2EC73CC2DCB2E4BA740020ACACD559D5740020C8FCC138C694002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다리시게 해서 죄송합니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B9ACC2DCAC8C0020D574C11C0020C8C4C1A1D569B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 본론으로 들어가도록 하죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C0020BCF8B860C73CB85C0020B4E4C5B4AC00B3C4B85D0020D558C8E0002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이차원 미르의 조사 비용 말입니다만,\n퀘이사 측의 부담이 적은 것 같지 않습니까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974C7580020C870C0AC0020BE44C6A90020B9D0C785B2C8B2E4B9CC002C000AD018C774C0AC0020CE21C7580020BD80B2F4C7740020C801C7400020AC830020AC19C9C00020C54AC2B5B2C8AE4C003F00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 건은 처음에 합의한 사항이기도 하고,\n기자재는 저희가 제공하고 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020AC74C7400020CC98C74CC5D00020D569C758D55C0020C0ACD56DC774AE30B3C40020D558ACE0002C000AAE30C790C7ACB2940020C800D76CAC000020C81CACF5D558ACE00020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기자재의 개발에도\n비용이 든다는 것은 잘 아실 텐데요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C790C7ACC7580020AC1CBC1CC5D0B3C4000ABE44C6A9C7740020B4E0B2E4B2940020AC83C7400020C7980020C544C2E40020D150B370C694002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 점에 대해서는 저희도 잘 알고 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그렇지만, 조사 대상이 워낙 많아서\n인력이 상상 이상으로 들어가고 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사람은 일하면 지치기 마련이죠.\n그걸 버티게 해 주는 게 돈 아니겠습니까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB78CC7400020C77CD558BA740020C9C0CE58AE300020B9C8B828C774C8E0002E000AADF8AC780020BC84D2F0AC8C0020D5740020C8FCB2940020AC8C0020B3C80020C544B2C8ACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금부터 변경하려 해도\n예산 심의에 상당한 시간이 걸릴 겁니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE08BD80D1300020BCC0ACBDD558B8240020D574B3C4000AC608C0B00020C2ECC758C5D00020C0C1B2F9D55C0020C2DCAC04C7740020AC78B9B40020AC81B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 점도 잘 알고 있습니다. 귀사께서는\n도시 개발을 책임지고 있는 대기업이니까요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020C810B3C40020C7980020C54CACE00020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E0020ADC0C0ACAED8C11CB294000AB3C4C2DC0020AC1CBC1CC7440020CC45C784C9C0ACE00020C788B2940020B300AE30C5C5C774B2C8AE4CC694002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만, 도시 개발을 위해\n조사가 중요하다는 것도 잘 아실 텐데요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C9C0B9CC002C0020B3C4C2DC0020AC1CBC1CC7440020C704D574000AC870C0ACAC000020C911C694D558B2E4B2940020AC83B3C40020C7980020C544C2E40020D150B370C694002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "서로 도시를 위하는 입장이긴 하지만,\n이래서는 결말이 나지 않겠군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C11CB85C0020B3C4C2DCB97C0020C704D558B2940020C785C7A5C774AE340020D558C9C0B9CC002C000AC774B798C11CB2940020ACB0B9D0C7740020B098C9C00020C54AACA0AD70C694002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...이렇게 된 이상,\n포켓몬 승부로 정하는 건 어떠신지요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EC774B807AC8C0020B41C0020C774C0C1002C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B85C0020C815D558B2940020AC740020C5B4B5A0C2E0C9C0C694002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "문제없습니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n저는 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨를 이번 승부를 위한\n비즈니스 파트너로 지정하도록 하죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB38C81CC5C6C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE01000AC800B294002000100002010000000020C528B97C0020C774BC880020C2B9BD80B97C0020C704D55C000ABE44C988B2C8C2A40020D30CD2B8B108B85C0020C9C0C815D558B3C4B85D0020D558C8E0002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네에!?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124C5D00021003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이건 비즈니스이니\n카라스바 씨를 기다리지 않게 해 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC740020BE44C988B2C8C2A4C774B2C8000ACE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528B97C0020AE30B2E4B9ACC9C00020C54AAC8C0020D5740020C8FCC138C694002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이건 제 자존심이 걸린 일이기도 합니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC740020C81C0020C790C874C2ECC7740020AC78B9B00020C77CC774AE30B3C40020D569B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "머스캣 씨와 담판을 짓게\n포켓몬 승부를 시작하자고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA38C2A4CEA30020C528C6400020B2F4D310C7440020C9D3AC8C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020C2DCC791D558C790ACE0002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 님의 체면을 지키기 위해서라도\n전력으로 두 분을 상대하겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020B2D8C7580020CCB4BA74C7440020C9C0D0A4AE300020C704D574C11CB77CB3C4000AC804B825C73CB85C0020B4500020BD84C7440020C0C1B300D558ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러지 말고 빨리 승부를 시작하자고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECC9C00020B9D0ACE00020BE68B9AC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020C2DCC791D558C790ACE0002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "허울 좋은 말만으로는\n사람을 움직이게 할 수 없단 말입니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5C8C6B80020C88BC7400020B9D0B9CCC73CB85CB294000AC0ACB78CC7440020C6C0C9C1C774AC8C0020D5600020C2180020C5C6B2E80020B9D0C785B2C8B2E4002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저희 녹청파에게는\n사람들을 일하게 한다는 자부심이 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800D76C0020B179CCADD30CC5D0AC8CB294000AC0ACB78CB4E4C7440020C77CD558AC8C0020D55CB2E4B2940020C790BD80C2ECC7740020C788C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 님의 체면도 있으니\n일절 봐드리지 않겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020B2D8C7580020CCB4BA74B3C40020C788C73CB2C8000AC77CC8080020BD10B4DCB9ACC9C00020C54AACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨를 더 기다리게 할 수는 없으니\n빨리 포켓몬 승부를 시작하죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528B97C0020B3540020AE30B2E4B9ACAC8C0020D5600020C218B2940020C5C6C73CB2C8000ABE68B9AC0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020C2DCC791D558C8E0002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "펜드라! 너와 함께라면\n지금 이 상황도 웃으며 돌파할 수 있어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D39CB4DCB77C00210020B108C6400020D568AED8B77CBA74000AC9C0AE080020C7740020C0C1D669B3C40020C6C3C73CBA700020B3CCD30CD5600020C2180020C788C5B4002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화를 통한 유대...\n무장조의 아름다움을 보여 드리겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020D1B5D55C0020C720B300002E002E002E000ABB34C7A5C870C7580020C544B984B2E4C6C0C7440020BCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "할비롱과 저는 일심동체!\n메가진화의 진가를 보여 드리겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D560BE44B871ACFC0020C800B2940020C77CC2ECB3D9CCB40021000ABA54AC00C9C4D654C7580020C9C4AC00B97C0020BCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E40021001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 훌륭하십니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨가\n함께해 주시지 않았으면 제가 졌을 겁니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020D6CCB96DD558C2EDB2C8B2E4002E00100001BE01000A00100002010000000020C528AC00000AD568AED8D5740020C8FCC2DCC9C00020C54AC558C73CBA740020C81CAC000020C84CC7440020AC81B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "패배는 패배!\n조사 비용은 일단 그대로 가도록 하죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D328BC30B2940020D328BC300021000AC870C0AC0020BE44C6A9C7400020C77CB2E80020ADF8B300B85C0020AC00B3C4B85D0020D558C8E0002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저희가 식사량을 줄여서라도\n조직을 돕도록 하겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800D76CAC000020C2DDC0ACB7C9C7440020C904C5ECC11CB77CB3C4000AC870C9C1C7440020B3D5B3C4B85D0020D558ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "녹청파가 총동원해서 조사해 주고 계신 만큼\n최대한 빨리 심의를 통과시켜 보겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B179CCADD30CAC000020CD1DB3D9C6D0D574C11C0020C870C0ACD5740020C8FCACE00020ACC4C2E00020B9CCD07C000ACD5CB300D55C0020BE68B9AC0020C2ECC758B97C0020D1B5ACFCC2DCCF1C0020BCF4ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "식구들 몫은 당분간 내가\n자비로 충당하도록 하지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DDAD6CB4E40020BAABC7400020B2F9BD84AC040020B0B4AC00000AC790BE44B85C0020CDA9B2F9D558B3C4B85D0020D558C9C0002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n너에게도 특별 보너스를 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000AB108C5D0AC8CB3C40020D2B9BCC40020BCF4B108C2A4B97C0020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001> 다른 색의\n카라스바 코디 슈트 세트를 손에 넣었다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100002190000010020B2E4B9780020C0C9C758000ACE74B77CC2A4BC140020CF54B5140020C288D2B80020C138D2B8B97C0020C190C5D00020B123C5C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "요즘 헤어살롱에서\n나랑 똑같은 헤어스타일을 해 준다던데?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C694C9980020D5E4C5B4C0B4B871C5D0C11C000AB098B7910020B611AC19C7400020D5E4C5B4C2A4D0C0C77CC7440020D5740020C900B2E4B358B370003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "머스캣 씨,\n미르를 지금보다 더 좋은 도시로 만들면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n사람들이 돈을 펑펑 쓸 겁니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA38C2A4CEA30020C528002C000ABBF8B974B97C0020C9C0AE08BCF4B2E40020B3540020C88BC7400020B3C4C2DCB85C0020B9CCB4E4BA7400100001BE00000AC0ACB78CB4E4C7740020B3C8C7440020D391D3910020C4F80020AC81B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저도 동의합니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그러기 위해서라도 녹청파분들과는\n지금보다 더 좋은 관계를 구축하고 싶습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B3C40020B3D9C758D569B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE01000AADF8B7ECAE300020C704D574C11CB77CB3C40020B179CCADD30CBD84B4E4ACFCB294000AC9C0AE08BCF4B2E40020B3540020C88BC7400020AD00ACC4B97C0020AD6CCD95D558ACE00020C2F6C2B5B2C8B2E4002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도시는 변해 가더라도\n내가 살았던 흔적이 남아 있어서 좋아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4C2DCB2940020BCC0D5740020AC00B354B77CB3C4000AB0B4AC000020C0B4C558B3580020D754C801C7740020B0A8C5440020C788C5B4C11C0020C88BC544002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "불량배였던 저희를 품어 준 도시에\n어떻게 해서든 은혜를 갚고 싶습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD88B7C9BC30C600B3580020C800D76CB97C0020D488C5B40020C9000020B3C4C2DCC5D0000AC5B4B5BBAC8C0020D574C11CB4E00020C740D61CB97C0020AC1AACE00020C2F6C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨에게 신념이 있듯이\n제게도 신념이 있습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3656,
